  The cache key includes every array shape, so a system size this machine has not run before misses every entry no matter how warm the cache looks.
  The fail-fast excepthook is installed, so an uncaught exception on any rank exits the step non-zero instead of leaving its peers blocked in a collective that rank will never join.
